# Add patterns of files dvc should ignore, which could improve
# the performance. Learn more at
# https://dvc.org/doc/user-guide/dvcignore

# Security: Never track sensitive files
*.env
*.env.*
*credentials*
*secrets*
*api_key*
*apikey*
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx

# System files
.DS_Store
._.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
**/._.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
